Z||000000||Spektrum-87GT||11-09-2001||06:05 PM||||well, as some of you know, i got in a little accident the other night because of my own stupidity. Well, i'm 19 and live at home, and the parents are saying my fiero gt must go. there's one big problem, i dont want to sell it! i love it too much and could never bring myself to sell it, its in my name, so the final say is mine. But i have a feeling I'll get kicked out if I decide to keep it. Anyone have any suggestions? i suggested keeping it off the road for a while. i'm not selling it, no way no how, i've waited too long for this car to sell it after owning it for 2 months and putting less than 2k miles on it.||||reg||9
